#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:501
msgid "Nim the Peddler"
msgstr "货郎尼姆"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:506
msgid ""
"Psst! Keywright! Shutters down? Good. Nim's pack is full of things that came out of chests and never went back in."
msgstr "嘘！钥匠！关好店门了？好。尼姆的包里装满了从宝箱里出来、就再也没回去的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:507
msgid ""
"Evening! Nim kept the good ones for you. Well. Nim kept some ones for you."
msgstr "晚上好！尼姆把好东西都给你留着呢。呃……尼姆给你留了些东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:508
msgid ""
"Quick, before the Guild's night watch comes round the corner. Look, look, but don't point."
msgstr "快，趁公会的巡夜人还没拐过街角。看吧看吧，就是别用手指。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:509
msgid ""
"Out of a wizard's strongroom, these, this very night. The wizard won't miss them. Nim checked."
msgstr "这些啊，就是今晚从一位巫师的密库里出来的。那巫师不会惦记它们的。尼姆确认过了。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:510
msgid "A good day? Nim heard. Nim hears everything after dark."
msgstr "今天生意不错？尼姆听说了。天黑以后，尼姆什么都听得见。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:515
msgid "Good eye. Nim would have kept that one, if Nim were the keeping sort."
msgstr "好眼力。尼姆要是那种留得住东西的人，这件早就自己留下了。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:516
msgid "Done! Treat it kindly. It's older than the Guild."
msgstr "成交！好好待它。它比公会还老呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:517
msgid "It likes you. Nim can always tell when they like someone."
msgstr "它喜欢你。它们喜欢谁，尼姆总能看出来。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:520
msgid "Nim's off. Tomorrow night, same back door."
msgstr "尼姆走啦。明晚老时间，还是这扇后门。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:520
msgid "Mind the Guild, Keywright. Nim always does."
msgstr "当心公会，钥匠。尼姆一向很当心。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:521
msgid "Sleep well. Nim never does."
msgstr "睡个好觉。尼姆可从来睡不好。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:524
msgid "Oh, Nim likes it here. Nim will bring more. Every night, more!"
msgstr "哦，尼姆喜欢这儿。尼姆会带更多来。每晚都带更多！"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:527
msgid "Back to its owner? How honest. Nim won't tell his friends."
msgstr "还给失主？真老实。尼姆不会告诉他的朋友们。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:528
msgid ""
"Nim's friends will see it gets back to whoever wants it most. For a price. Always a price."
msgstr "尼姆的朋友们会让它回到最想要它的人手里。当然得收钱。总是要收钱的。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:531
msgid "That would leave your purse thin, that would. Still want it?"
msgstr "这样你的钱袋可就瘪了，瘪得很哟。还要吗？"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:534
msgid "Not to your taste? Nim has more. Nim always has more."
msgstr "不合你的口味？尼姆还有。尼姆总是还有。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:537
msgid "Back in the pack it goes. Half what you paid: Nim's fair, ask anyone."
msgstr "那就回包里去喽。退你一半的钱：尼姆最公道了，不信随便问谁。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:72
msgid "Fair Day"
msgstr "集市日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:72
msgid "The whole county's in town for the fair: three more customers today."
msgstr "全郡的人都进城赶集了：今天多三位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:73
msgid "Locking Day"
msgstr "大封锁日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:73
msgid ""
"Three hundred years since the Locking, and everyone's celebrating: everything sells for a quarter more today."
msgstr "大封锁三百周年，人人都在庆祝：今天所有东西售价提高四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:74
msgid "The Crown's Buyer"
msgstr "王室采办"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:74
msgid "The Crown's buyer is in town, paying double for {kind} today."
msgstr "王室采办来到城里，今天以双倍价格收购{kind}。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:75
msgid "A Royal Chest"
msgstr "皇家宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:75
msgid ""
"Someone's bringing in one of King Aldric's own chests, gilded, with the royal seal. They think the gold is paint."
msgstr "有人要拿来一只奥德里克国王本人的宝箱，镀着金，还盖着皇家印记。他们以为那层金是漆。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:76 scripts/Core/Events.cs:199
msgid "The Stranger"
msgstr "陌生人"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:76
msgid ""
"A stranger in black is coming by with a chest wrapped in iron chains. Nothing in it can rattle."
msgstr "一位黑衣陌生人要带着一只缠满铁链的宝箱上门。箱里的东西一点都摇不响。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:77
msgid "A Storm"
msgstr "暴风雨"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:77
msgid ""
"Few will brave the rain, but those who do bring their best: chests come in a colour better."
msgstr "没几个人肯冒雨出门，但来的人都带着最好的货：宝箱颜色都高一档。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:78
msgid "A Barge Aground"
msgstr "驳船搁浅"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:78
msgid ""
"A treasure barge ran aground on the Aldwater: today's lots come in twos and threes."
msgstr "一艘运宝驳船在奥德河上搁浅了：今天的货都是成双成三的。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:79
msgid "A Foreclosure Sale"
msgstr "查封甩卖"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:79
msgid ""
"The Guild has foreclosed on a manor, and its chests are being sold off quick: everyone asks a fifth less today."
msgstr "公会查封了一座庄园，正急着把那里的宝箱甩卖出去：今天人人要价都低五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:80
msgid "The Tourney"
msgstr "比武大会"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:80
msgid ""
"Knights from four counties are in town for the tourney: weapons and cloaks sell for half again as much today."
msgstr "四个郡的骑士都进城参加比武大会：今天兵器和斗篷售价提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:81
msgid "A Day of Mourning"
msgstr "哀悼日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:81
msgid ""
"The old Duke is being buried, and the whole town's in black. Nobody will stand for a hard shake today."
msgstr "老公爵今天下葬，全城的人都穿上了黑衣。今天谁都容不得你猛摇。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:82
msgid "The Town Crier"
msgstr "街头传令员"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:82
msgid ""
"Old Lord Harrow lost his family's {kind} to the Locking. His crier offers a reward for one today: three times its price."
msgstr "老哈罗勋爵家传的{kind}在大封锁中失落了。今天他的传令员悬赏求购一件，出价是售价的三倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:83
msgid "The Minstrels' Fair"
msgstr "吟游诗人集会"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:83
msgid ""
"Minstrels are trading songs in the square, and anyone with a box that hums has brought it: a Heartsong is three times as likely today."
msgstr "吟游诗人们在广场上交换歌谣，凡是有会哼歌的箱子的人，都把它带来了：今天出现心歌的几率提高到三倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:84
msgid "The Sleepers' Moon"
msgstr "眠者之月"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:84
msgid ""
"The Old Wood's moon was full, and all who slept under it dreamt true, like Mother Sorrel: every seller tells you their dream. Some warded something."
msgstr "古林的月亮圆了，在月下入眠的人都像索蕾尔婆婆一样做了真梦：每位卖家都会告诉你他们的梦。有些人用结界封住了东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:85
msgid "Wardens' Day"
msgstr "巡守节"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:85
msgid ""
"The old custom: ward a keepsake into a chest before you sell it, and leave a riddle for it. Name the answer, and the ward gives it up."
msgstr "古老的习俗：卖宝箱之前，用结界把一件纪念品封进箱里，再为它留一个谜语。说出谜底，结界就会交出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:86 scripts/Core/Events.cs:114
msgid "The Guild's Count"
msgstr "公会清点"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:86
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild is counting everything that changes hands: a clerk tallies every article in every chest today, false bottoms and all."
msgstr "镀金公会正在清点每一件易手的东西：今天会有一名书记员清点每只宝箱里的每件物品，连夹层里的也不放过。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:87
msgid "The Guild's Assessor"
msgstr "公会估税员"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:87
msgid ""
"A Guild assessor sits in the corner all day, and takes a tenth of every sale for the Guild."
msgstr "一名公会估税员整天坐在角落里，每卖出一样东西，都要替公会抽走十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:88
msgid "A Witchlight Moon"
msgstr "巫灯之月"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:88
msgid ""
"Under a witchlight moon the old enchantments wake: things in today's chests are far likelier to be enchanted."
msgstr "巫灯之月下，古老的附魔纷纷苏醒：今天宝箱里的东西附魔的几率大大提高。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:100
msgid "Fair Day: +3 customers"
msgstr "集市日：顾客+3"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:101
msgid "Locking Day: sales +25%"
msgstr "大封锁日：售价+25%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:102
msgid "Crown buys {0} x2"
msgstr "王室收购{0}×2"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:103
msgid "A royal chest today"
msgstr "今日有皇家宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:104
msgid "The Stranger's in town"
msgstr "陌生人进城了"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:105
msgid "Storm: better chests"
msgstr "暴风雨：宝箱更好"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:106
msgid "Barge aground: pairs"
msgstr "驳船搁浅：成对"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:107
msgid "Foreclosure sale: -20%"
msgstr "查封甩卖：-20%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:108
msgid "Tourney: arms, cloaks"
msgstr "比武：兵器、斗篷"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:109
msgid "Mourning: no hard shake"
msgstr "哀悼日：禁止猛摇"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:110
msgid "Crier wants {0}"
msgstr "传令员求购{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:111
msgid "Minstrels: songs x3"
msgstr "吟游诗人：心歌×3"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:112
msgid "Sleepers' Moon: dreams"
msgstr "眠者之月：梦境"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:113
msgid "Wardens' Day: riddles"
msgstr "巡守节：谜语"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:115
msgid "Assessor: sales -10%"
msgstr "估税员：售价-10%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:116
msgid "Witchlight: more magic"
msgstr "巫灯之月：附魔更多"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:199
msgid "Stranger"
msgstr "陌生人"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:201
msgid ""
"A stranger in black who sells chests wrapped tight in iron chains, and never says where they're from. Nothing inside can move, so nothing rattles: all you can learn is how heavy it is, and heavy ones hold more."
msgstr ""
"一位黑衣陌生人，卖的宝箱都用铁链缠得紧紧的，也从不说箱子来自何处。里面的东西动弹不得，所以什么也摇不响：你只能知道它有多重，而越重的装得越多。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:203
msgid "Chained tight. No rattles, and no questions. {price}."
msgstr "锁链缠得死死的。不会响，也别多问。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:203
msgid "Where's it from? Somewhere that wanted it kept shut. {price}."
msgstr "从哪儿来的？从一个巴不得它永远锁着的地方。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:204
msgid "Some chests are better left shut. Not this one. {price}."
msgstr "有些箱子还是别打开为好。这只可不是。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:205
msgid "Wise."
msgstr "明智。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:205
msgid "We'll meet again."
msgstr "后会有期。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:206
msgid "Another time."
msgstr "改日吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:207
msgid "As you like."
msgstr "随你。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:207
msgid "Someone else, then."
msgstr "那就找别人。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:208 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:582
msgid "Careful."
msgstr "小心。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:208
msgid "It won't open for that."
msgstr "这样可打不开它。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:209
msgid "Careful. That will cost you."
msgstr "小心。这可要加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:18
msgid "Sight unseen"
msgstr "盲买"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:19
msgid "Bram's word"
msgstr "布拉姆的担保"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:20
msgid "Bram's stash"
msgstr "布拉姆的私房钱"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:21
msgid "A short night"
msgstr "缴不齐贡金之夜"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:22
msgid "A perfect read"
msgstr "完美判断"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:23
msgid "A step better"
msgstr "品质提升一级"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:24
msgid "A surprise"
msgstr "惊喜"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:25
msgid "A dry spell"
msgstr "霉运期"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:26
msgid "Exhibition points"
msgstr "展览分"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:27
msgid "A warded thing"
msgstr "被结界封住的物品"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:28
msgid "A false bottom"
msgstr "夹层"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:29
msgid "Haggling"
msgstr "讨价还价"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:30
msgid "Mended"
msgstr "修补"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:38
msgid ""
"A chest bought without shaking it, dropping it or putting the lodestone to it. The witchlight doesn't count, and nor does what the seller tells you. Once you've handled it, it's no longer sight unseen."
msgstr "没摇过、没摔过、也没用磁石碰过就买下的宝箱。用巫灯照一照不算，听卖家说什么也不算。只要你动过它，就不算盲买了。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:40
msgid ""
"On a Guild night you can't pay, Bram can vouch for you, once a run: the Guild takes all your gold, and what you still owe, half as much again, is added to next week's due. Not in the debt's last week."
msgstr "缴不起贡金的公会之夜，布拉姆可以为你担保，每局一次：公会拿走你所有的金币，你还欠的部分再加一半，计入下周的应缴贡金。还债的最后一周不能用。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:42
msgid ""
"{0} times a run, when a morning starts with under {1}g in your purse at the stall, Bram slips you {2}g from his secret stash (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr "每局{0}次：在摊位时期，若某天早上你的钱袋里不足{1}金，布拉姆就会从他的私房钱里偷偷塞给你{2}金（店铺越气派，数额越大）。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:44
msgid ""
"A Guild night when your purse can't cover the due. You can pawn what's on display (for {0} of its price), sell curios back (for half), call in a friend's favour, or take Bram's word."
msgstr "钱袋付不起应缴贡金的公会之夜。你可以典当陈列品（按售价的{0}），把奇物卖回去（半价），找欠你人情的朋友帮忙，或者动用布拉姆的担保。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:47
msgid ""
"Your slip named exactly what came out: how many of each kind, which were enchanted, and the false bottom or warded thing if there was one. Nothing missed, nothing extra."
msgstr "你的估价单与开出的东西分毫不差：每类各有几件、哪些附魔，有夹层或被结界封住的物品时也都标对了。一样不漏，一样不多。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:49
msgid ""
"One colour finer than its chest promised: common, uncommon, rare, epic. Luck never makes a thing gold: a purple thing it would lift comes out enchanted instead."
msgstr "比宝箱颜色所示的品质高一级：普通、优良、稀有、史诗，逐级往上。运气永远不会让东西变成金色：本该被运气提升的紫色物品，会改为附魔。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:51
msgid ""
"A thing that comes out a step better than its chest's colour promised. A bad surprise is a step worse."
msgstr "开出来比宝箱颜色所示品质高一级的物品。惊吓则是低一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:52
msgid ""
"Things opened one after another that came out no better than their chest. After {0}, each chest you buy gets a growing chance ({1} more for every thing since, up to {2}) that something in it comes out a step better."
msgstr ""
"接连开出的东西，品质都没有高过所在的宝箱。连续{0}件之后，你买的每只宝箱都会有越来越高的几率（此后每多一件提高{1}，最多{2}），让其中某样东西品质提升一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:55
msgid ""
"What's on your display shelf scores points: 1 for a common thing, 2 uncommon, 4 rare, 8 epic, 16 gold, twice that if enchanted. Points draw customers and finer chests."
msgstr "陈列在展架上的东西会得分：普通1分，优良2分，稀有4分，史诗8分，金色16分，附魔再翻倍。分数能吸引顾客和更好的宝箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:57
msgid ""
"One thing a chest's last owner hid with a ward: it never sounds, weighs nothing and isn't counted. It comes out only if your slip names it: mark one more of its kind than you heard."
msgstr "宝箱上一任主人用结界藏起的一样东西：它从不出声，没有重量，也不计入件数。只有估价单说中它，它才会现身：在它那一类上，比你听到的多标一件。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:59
msgid ""
"A hidden compartment under the chest's floor. Dropped from high up, the chest lands with a hollow boom; mark the false bottom on your slip and what's under it comes out."
msgstr "宝箱底板下的暗格。从高处摔下时，宝箱落地会发出空洞的“咚”声；在估价单上勾选夹层，底下的东西就会现身。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:61
msgid ""
"A seller who haggles takes an offer: pick your price on the slider. They take it, come part of the way down, or walk out if you go too low."
msgstr "肯讨价还价的卖家会接受出价：在滑块上选好你的价钱。他们会接受、让一部分价，或者在你压得太低时掉头就走。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:63
msgid "Nothing of that kind comes out worse than its chest promised."
msgstr "该类物品开出来绝不会低于宝箱应有的品质。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:68 scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:102 scripts/Core/Offers.cs:69
#: scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:423 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:564 scripts/Ui/UiKit.cs:337
msgid "{0}: {1}"
msgstr "{0}：{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:55
msgid "Mister Vane"
msgstr "韦恩先生"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:60
msgid ""
"Good evening. The Guild's tithe, if you please. In gold: the Guild has no use for promises."
msgstr "晚上好。烦请缴纳公会的贡金。只收金子：承诺对公会毫无用处。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:61
msgid ""
"Still here, I see. Good. The Guild hates to see a Keywright go to waste."
msgstr "看来你还在。很好。公会最见不得一位钥匠被白白浪费。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:62
msgid ""
"I hear you've opened a great many chests this week. The Guild approves. Do keep opening them."
msgstr "听说你这周开了许多宝箱。公会很是赞许。请务必继续开下去。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:63
msgid ""
"Halfway, Keywright. The Guild has been very patient with Bram's stall. It would hate to stop."
msgstr "已经过半了，钥匠。公会对布拉姆的摊位一直很有耐心。它可不想哪天收起这份耐心。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:64
msgid ""
"The Guild hears you've been making friends this season. How touching. Friends don't pay tithes."
msgstr "公会听说你这一季交了不少朋友。真令人感动。可朋友是不会替你交贡金的。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:65
msgid ""
"My masters have begun to ask about you. That is rarely good news. One more week after this one."
msgstr "我的主人们开始打听你了。这很少是什么好消息。这周之后，只剩最后一周了。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:66
msgid "The last of Bram's debt. Every coin of it, mind. Gold you can see."
msgstr "布拉姆债务的最后一笔。记住，分文不能少。要看得见的金子。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:71
msgid ""
"Debts are curious things, Keywright. They grow while nobody's watching them."
msgstr "债务真是奇妙的东西，钥匠。没人盯着的时候，它们就会悄悄长大。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:72
msgid ""
"The Gate is hungry this week, and the Guild has decided you owe it something for its patience."
msgstr "这周大门格外饥饿，公会认为，它这么有耐心，你总得付出点代价。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:73
msgid ""
"Interest, you understand. Nothing personal. My master is very fond of interest."
msgstr "利息，你明白的。并非针对你个人。我的主人非常喜爱利息。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:80
msgid "Paid in full. The Guild has no further claim on Bram's stall. For now."
msgstr "全数付清。公会对布拉姆的摊位再无任何索求。暂时如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:81
msgid "Paid. Until next week, Keywright."
msgstr "已付清。下周见，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:82
msgid "Paid, and promptly. Until next week, then."
msgstr "付清了，还很准时。那就下周见。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:85
msgid ""
"Short? Then the Guild will take what's on your shelf instead. At the Guild's price, naturally."
msgstr "不够？那公会就拿你展架上的东西来抵。当然，是按公会定的价。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:88
msgid ""
"Not enough. The Guild seals this shop tonight, and your licence with it. Your uncle will be so disappointed."
msgstr "还是不够。公会今晚就查封这家店，你的执照也一并吊销。你叔叔该有多失望啊。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:89
msgid ""
"Not enough. The Guild seals this shop tonight, and your licence with it. Bram will be so disappointed."
msgstr "还是不够。公会今晚就查封这家店，你的执照也一并吊销。布拉姆该有多失望啊。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:92
msgid ""
"A Guild note, older than the Locking? ...However did you come by that? The Guild honours its own paper. Paid."
msgstr "一张比大封锁还古老的公会本票？……你究竟是从哪儿弄来的？公会向来承认自己的票据。已付清。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:95
msgid ""
"All of it, tonight? ...How very thorough of you. The Guild has no further claim on Bram's stall."
msgstr "今晚全部付清？……你可真是一丝不苟。公会对布拉姆的摊位再无任何索求。"

#: scripts/Core/Guild.cs:98
msgid ""
"Bram's word? How touching. One week, then. The rest comes due next week, and half as much again."
msgstr "布拉姆的担保？真令人感动。那就宽限一周。剩下的下周到期，还要多付一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:81
msgid "The Lullaby Box"
msgstr "摇篮曲八音盒"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:81
msgid "plink"
msgstr "叮咚"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:81
msgid "a farmer's wife at Brindle"
msgstr "布林德尔的一位农妇"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:82
msgid ""
"She gave the music box that sang her children to sleep. It still plays her lullaby, for a Keywright."
msgstr "她献出了那只曾哄她的孩子们入睡的八音盒。如今，它依然会为钥匠奏响她的摇篮曲。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:83
msgid ""
"Calms every seller: nobody hurries you or minds what you do with their chest, and all ask a fifth less."
msgstr "安抚每一位卖家：没人催你，也没人在意你怎么摆弄他们的宝箱，而且人人要价都低五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:84
msgid "The Shepherd's Pipe"
msgstr "牧人之笛"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:84
msgid "toodle"
msgstr "嘀哩哩"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:84
msgid "a shepherd of the Brindle hills"
msgstr "布林德尔山间的一位牧羊人"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:85
msgid "He gave the pipe whose tune could call any flock home. It still calls."
msgstr "他献出了那支笛子，它的曲调能唤回任何羊群。如今它依然在呼唤。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:86
msgid ""
"Calls folk to your door: two more customers a day, and anyone who walks out comes back at their first price."
msgstr "把人们唤到你门前：每天多两位顾客，而且掉头走掉的人都会回来，按他们最初的开价出售。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:87
msgid "The Fey Chimes"
msgstr "仙灵风铃"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:87
msgid "ting"
msgstr "玎玲"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:87
msgid "the fair folk of the Old Wood"
msgstr "古林的仙灵"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:88
msgid ""
"They gave the chimes from over their door between the worlds. Where they ring, luck turns."
msgstr "他们献出了挂在两界之门上的风铃。风铃响处，时来运转。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:89
msgid ""
"Fey luck: a third of what comes out as its chest promised comes out a step better."
msgstr "仙灵的好运：本该符合宝箱品质的物品中，有三分之一会提升一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:90
msgid "The Dragon's Egg"
msgstr "巨龙之卵"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:90
msgid "thump"
msgstr "怦怦"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:90
msgid "Ysolt, the last dragon of the Ember Peaks"
msgstr "伊苏尔特，余烬峰最后的巨龙"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:91
msgid ""
"She gave her egg, still warm. Three hundred years on, its heart still beats."
msgstr "她献出了自己的蛋，那时还带着余温。三百年过去了，它的心依然在跳动。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:92
msgid "Dragon-gold: coin and gems you sell fetch twice their worth."
msgstr "龙之金：你卖出的钱币和宝石，能卖到其价值的两倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:93
msgid "The Clockwork Lark"
msgstr "发条云雀"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:93
msgid "tweet"
msgstr "啾啾"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:93
msgid "a tinker of Crownhold"
msgstr "王冠堡的一位修补匠"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:94
msgid ""
"He gave the bird he built for a princess who never woke. It sings at dawn, and carries word."
msgstr "他献出了那只为一位再也没醒来的公主打造的鸟儿。它在黎明时歌唱，还能传递消息。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:95
msgid ""
"Carries word across Aldmark: two more commissions a week, and every commission pays half as much again."
msgstr "把消息传遍奥德马克：每周多两个委托，而且每个委托的报酬都提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:96
msgid "The Hearthstone"
msgstr "炉心石"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:96
msgid "hummm"
msgstr "嗡——"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:96
msgid "the dwarves of Ironroot"
msgstr "铁根的矮人"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:97
msgid ""
"They gave a stone from their first hearth. It hums with three thousand years of warm evenings."
msgstr "他们献出了一块取自他们第一座炉膛的石头。它嗡嗡低鸣，蕴藏着三千年来无数个温暖的夜晚。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:98
msgid ""
"Folk come for miles to sit by it: {0}g a night for each point of exhibition (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr "人们从老远赶来，只为在它身旁坐一坐：每一展览分每晚带来{0}金（店铺越气派，金额越高）。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:99 scripts/Core/TaleBook.Crownhold.cs:18
msgid "The Drowned Bell"
msgstr "沉钟"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:99
msgid "dong"
msgstr "铛"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:99
msgid "old Aldwater, before the river took it"
msgstr "被河水吞没之前的旧奥德河镇"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:100
msgid ""
"The town gave its chapel bell, which rang the hours for every soul in Aldwater. It still counts, under the water."
msgstr "全镇献出了小教堂的钟，它曾为奥德河镇的每一个人报时。如今沉在水底，它依然在计数。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:101
msgid ""
"It counts for you: as a chest comes to the counter, it tolls once for each thing inside, false bottom and all."
msgstr "它为你计数：宝箱一来到柜台，箱里每有一件东西，它就敲响一声，连夹层里的也算。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:102
msgid "The Bottled Star"
msgstr "瓶中星"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:102
msgid "twinkle"
msgstr "铃铃"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:102
msgid "the archmages of the Keyhold"
msgstr "钥堡的大法师们"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:103
msgid ""
"They gave a star they caught as students and kept in a bottle all their lives. Things from the Locking gather round it."
msgstr "他们献出了一颗星星，那是他们还在求学时捉到的，一生都装在瓶子里。大封锁时期的东西都会被它吸引过来。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:104
msgid ""
"Starlight: enchanted things glow whenever they sound, witchlight or not, and turn up far more often."
msgstr "星光：附魔物品只要发出声响就会发光，有没有巫灯都一样，而且出现得频繁得多。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:105
msgid "The Imp's Ember"
msgstr "小恶魔之烬"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:105
msgid "crackle"
msgstr "噼啪"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:105
msgid "Pib, an imp who loved a miller's daughter"
msgstr "皮布，一个爱上了磨坊主女儿的小恶魔"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:106
msgid ""
"He gave his own heart, a coal that never goes out, so the Maw could never have her."
msgstr "他献出了自己的心，一块永不熄灭的炭火，好让巨口永远得不到她。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:107
msgid ""
"Tempers all it warms: glass never breaks, nothing comes out worse than promised, and fakes you open burn true."
msgstr "它温暖的一切都得到淬炼：玻璃永远不碎，没有东西会低于应有的品质，你打开的假货也会炼成真货。"

#: scripts/Core/Heartsongs.cs:115
msgid ""
"A lock of gold could never hold the demon of greed. So at the Locking the archmages asked the peoples of Aldmark for things they loved more than gold, and sang the Locking into nine of them: the Heartsongs. Then they hid each in an ordinary chest, among millions. Only a Keywright hears one sing. To anyone else it's worth nothing, and the Guild won't touch one: greed can't put a price on it."
msgstr ""
"黄金之锁永远困不住贪婪之魔。于是在大封锁时，大法师们向奥德马克的各族人民求取他们爱得胜过黄金的东西，把大封锁唱进了其中九件：这就是心歌。随后，他们把每一首都藏进一只寻常的宝箱，混在千千万万只宝箱之中。只有钥匠能听见心歌歌唱。对其他人来说，它一文不值，公会也不会碰它：贪婪无法为它定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:12
msgid "Uncle Bram"
msgstr "布拉姆叔叔"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:12
msgid "Bram"
msgstr "布拉姆"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:20
msgid ""
"Morning! Here's the trick of it: a chest opens for you once you've paid for it, and nobody can see inside, so everyone shakes it and guesses. Pip never even shook his. Drag the chest slowly from side to side: that's a gentle shake."
msgstr ""
"早啊！窍门是这样的：宝箱付了钱，就会为你打开；可谁也看不见里面，所以人人都是摇一摇、猜一猜。皮普连摇都没摇过他那只。把宝箱慢慢地左右拖动：这就是轻摇。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:23
msgid ""
"Your back won't take a hard shake or a drop, Hesk, but your scale doesn't lie. Weigh what you heard against what's on the scale: whatever's left over is something you couldn't hear, or something under a false bottom."
msgstr ""
"赫斯克，你的腰经不起猛摇，也摔不了箱子，不过你的秤可从不撒谎。把你听到的东西的重量，跟秤上的读数对一对：多出来的，要么是你听不到的东西，要么藏在夹层里。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:25
msgid ""
"Everybody haggles with you, Rosa, though they open a bit higher, knowing you. Make your offer with the slider. Too low and they'll let you try again, but walk one out of the door and they won't be back this week."
msgstr ""
"罗莎，人人都跟你讨价还价，只不过他们知道你的本事，开价会高一点。用滑块出价。出价太低的话，他们会让你再试一次；可要是把谁气得掉头就走，这周他就不会再来了。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:27
msgid ""
"Your shelf's up from the first day, Isolde. Keep what you love: visitors pay at the door every night, {0}g for every {1} points of exhibition. Just remember the Guild won't take your collection in pawn on a short night."
msgstr ""
"伊索尔德，你的展架从第一天起就摆好了。把喜欢的东西留下陈列：每天晚上访客都会在门口付钱，每{1}展览分{0}金。只是记住，缴不齐贡金的夜里，公会可不收你的藏品作典当。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:29
msgid ""
"Hear that jingle? Coin. Light things rattle at the gentlest shake. Tick Coin on your slip, there on the right."
msgstr "听见那叮当声了吗？是钱币。轻巧的东西，轻摇一下就会响。在右边的估价单上勾选钱币。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:30
msgid ""
"Your slip adds up what you've ticked, valued as good as the chest's colour promises. The bar underneath is your odds that it's worth more than the price: the greener, the safer."
msgstr "估价单会把你勾选的东西加起来，按宝箱颜色应有的品质估值。下面那根胜算条，表示它的价值超过要价的可能性：越绿越稳妥。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:32
msgid ""
"Ada only shook it gently. Nothing heavy or soft stirs for a gentle shake, so she's priced only what she heard. Try every strength yourself: gentle, firm and hard."
msgstr "艾达只轻摇了一下。轻摇时，沉重的和轻软的东西都不会动，所以她只给自己听到的东西定了价。你自己把每种力度都试一遍：轻摇、稳摇和猛摇。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:34
msgid ""
"That flump is a cloak. Soft things only make a sound when you shake hard."
msgstr "那噗的一声，是斗篷。轻软的东西只有猛摇才会出声。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:35
msgid ""
"Garrick shook it hard, and when something clanks, it drowns out anything delicate. Shake it yourself, at every strength."
msgstr "加里克是猛摇的，而一旦有东西哐啷作响，就会盖过所有细微的声音。你自己摇一摇，每种力度都试试。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:36
msgid ""
"Clank: a weapon, an axe or a blade. It only moves when you shake firmly, and while it's clanking you can't hear anything delicate. Shake gently to hear past it."
msgstr "哐啷：是兵器，斧头或者刀剑。要稳摇它才会动，而它一哐啷作响，你就听不见任何细微的声音。轻摇，就能避开它，听见别的声音。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:38
msgid ""
"Bettany counts the rattles at a firm shake and charges the same for each. If you can't hear anything she didn't, pass: a seller always asks a bit more than what they've heard is worth."
msgstr "贝塔妮稳摇后数响声，每一声都按同样的价钱算。要是你没听出什么她没听到的东西，就别买：卖家的要价，总比他们听到的东西值的钱多一点。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:40
msgid ""
"When you pass, they take it home unopened, and you'll never know for sure. But your gut usually has an opinion."
msgstr "你不买，他们就会把箱子原封不动地带回家，你永远无法确知里面有什么。不过你的直觉通常自有看法。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:41
msgid ""
"Your mark went cold: that chest isn't theirs to sell, and it won't open for whoever buys it. Pass on it, or send for the Wardens: they pay a finder's share."
msgstr "你的钥纹发凉了：那只宝箱不归他们，他们无权出售，谁买了也打不开。别买，或者报告巡守：他们会付你一份发现者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:43
msgid ""
"Not everyone comes to sell. People have their own troubles, and what you say to them comes back: who comes, what they bring, and who's on your side. The notebook's Town page keeps track."
msgstr "不是每个人都是来卖东西的。人人都有自己的烦心事，你对他们说的话都会有回响：谁会来，带来什么，谁站在你这边。笔记本的城镇页会一一记下。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:45
msgid ""
"The best tools aren't sold in shops: the people who make them bring them to the counter. Say no, and they'll ask again in a few days."
msgstr "最好的工具在店里可买不到：做工具的人会亲自送到柜台前。你要是回绝了，过几天他们还会再来问。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:47
msgid "A tick is a good read. A cross is something to listen for next time."
msgstr "打勾的，是你判断对了。打叉的，下次要留心去听。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:48
msgid ""
"You bought that one sight unseen, so there was nothing to read: a closed eye is a thing you never marked, not a mistake. Handle a chest before you buy it and your slip is checked as usual."
msgstr "那只箱子是你盲买的，所以本来就无从判断：闭着的眼睛表示那是你没标记的东西，不算出错。买之前动过箱子，估价单就会照常核对。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:50
msgid ""
"That's a day's trading. Every coin goes toward the stall: once it's earned {0}g, all told, we'll talk about Thornwick."
msgstr "一天的买卖就这样做完了。赚的每个子儿都算在摊位上：等它前前后后赚满{0}金，咱们再来谈荆棘镇的事。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:53
msgid ""
"Look at the chest's colour: plain wood, green, blue, purple. The Wardens painted them by what went in, so the colour tells you how good the things inside tend to be. Only tend to: you'll get surprises both ways."
msgstr "看看宝箱的颜色：原木、绿、蓝、紫。巡守当年按装进去的东西给箱子上了色，所以颜色能告诉你里面的东西大致有多好。只是大致：好坏两头都会有意外。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:55
msgid ""
"See? Not everything matches its chest. Mostly it does; sometimes it's a little worse; now and then it's much better."
msgstr "看见了吧？不是每样东西都跟箱子相称。大多数时候是相称的；有时会差一点；偶尔会好得多。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:56
msgid "This one names a price. Take it or leave it."
msgstr "这位开的是一口价：要就买，不要拉倒。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:57
msgid ""
"This one haggles, so they'll start high. Use the slider to make one offer: they'll take it, name a final price, or storm off if you insult them."
msgstr "这位爱讨价还价，所以开价会很高。用滑块出一次价：他们要么接受，要么报个最终价，要是你出价低得侮辱人，他们会气冲冲地走掉。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:59
msgid ""
"This one wants you to name a price. Offer what it's worth to you, less a little. You get two tries."
msgstr "这位要你自己出价。出个你觉得它值的价钱，再压低一点。你有两次机会。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:60
msgid "Too low. One more try, then they'll go."
msgstr "出价太低了。还能再试一次，再不行人家就走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:61
msgid ""
"Everyone you've traded with has a page in your notebook: how they judge a chest, how they trade, what they're like. Click whoever's at the counter to read theirs."
msgstr "跟你做过买卖的人，在你的笔记本里都有一页：他们怎么判断宝箱，怎么做买卖，是个什么样的人。点击柜台前的人，就能看到他那一页。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:63
msgid ""
"Listen to where they say it came from. A barrow holds grave goods, a goblin warren mostly coin, a dwarf-hold weapons and gems."
msgstr "留心听他们说箱子是从哪儿来的。古冢里是陪葬品，哥布林地洞里多半是钱币，矮人要塞里是兵器和宝石。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:65
msgid ""
"Something grand? You can keep it for display instead of selling it. A good exhibition brings more customers, and better ones. Enchanted things count double."
msgstr "是件好东西？你可以把它留下陈列，不必卖掉。好的展览能招来更多顾客，而且是更好的顾客。附魔物品算双倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:67
msgid "On display. You'll see it on the shelf behind the counter."
msgstr "陈列好了。你能在柜台后面的展架上看到它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:68
msgid ""
"Your exhibition. Click anything in it to sell it, if you need the money."
msgstr "这是你的展览。要是缺钱，点击里面任何一件就能卖掉。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:71
msgid ""
"{0}g earned: the stall pays its way! Thornwick Market has more customers, richer chests and room for a shelf. But Thornwick chests cost more, so keep enough for tomorrow's. A price in red means it would leave you short: better to wait a day."
msgstr ""
"赚满{0}金了：这摊位能自己养活自己啦！荆棘镇集市顾客更多，宝箱更值钱，还有地方摆展架。不过荆棘镇的宝箱也更贵，所以得留够明天买箱子的钱。价钱要是显示成红色，就说明买了之后你会手头吃紧：最好再等一天。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:72
msgid ""
"Nearly broke? I keep a little put by for days like this. Don't tell the Guild. It won't last forever: the day card says how much is left."
msgstr "快没钱了？我为这种日子留了点私房钱。别告诉公会。这钱可撑不了一辈子：每天开张时的那张卡片会写着还剩几次。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:74
msgid ""
"A shelf behind the counter, with room for one thing! Keep something grand on display instead of selling it: an exhibition draws more customers, and better chests. Each cabinet you buy makes room for one more."
msgstr "柜台后面有展架了，能摆一件东西！把好东西留下来陈列，别卖掉：展览能招来更多顾客，还有更好的宝箱。每买一个柜子，就能多摆一件。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:76
msgid ""
"Crownhold folk know a shop by what it collects. Your notebook has tallied everything you've acquired: {0} of a kind earns a synergy. Open Synergies, bottom right, to put one to work or see how close you are."
msgstr ""
"王冠堡的人看一家店，就看它收藏了什么。你的笔记本记下了你得到过的每样东西：同类物品凑齐{0}件，就能达成一个羁绊。打开右下角的羁绊，启用一个，或者看看还差多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:77
msgid "Another synergy slot: open Synergies and put one more to work."
msgstr "又多了一个羁绊栏位：打开羁绊，再启用一个。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:78
msgid ""
"The Royal Emporium, in the palace's shadow. The Gate's just down the street: you can feel it hum. There are bigger things to grow into now: a night market, a patrons' book, a velvet case for curios. Keep enough back for Vane."
msgstr ""
"皇家商行，就在王宫的影子底下。大门就在街那头：你能感觉到它在嗡嗡作响。现在可以置办更大的家业了：夜市、委托人名册、放奇物的天鹅绒匣。记得给韦恩留够钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:80
msgid ""
"Forgotten a sound, or someone's habits? Press N for your notebook: the sounds, the regulars you've met, and a calendar of what's coming."
msgstr "忘了某种声音，或者谁的习惯？按N打开笔记本：里面有各种声音、你见过的常客，还有日历，写着接下来有什么安排。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:82
msgid ""
"That's the Guild's next due, up top. Click it any time for the whole debt in your notebook: what's paid, what's left, and what each week will want."
msgstr "上面那个，是公会的下一笔应缴贡金。随时点它，就能在笔记本里看到整笔债务：已经付了多少，还剩多少，往后每周要缴多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:84
msgid ""
"The ward's let go: the chest is yours. Now for the old lock underneath. The pick sweeps round: press {act}, or click, while it's in the green to set a pin. Set every pin cleanly and nothing inside gets scratched."
msgstr ""
"结界解开了：这只宝箱归你了。接下来对付底下那把老锁。撬锁器会绕着转圈：趁它转到绿区时，按{act}或点击，就能让一个锁销到位。每个锁销都干净利落地到位，里面的东西就一点也不会刮花。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:88
msgid ""
"Paid. Next week the Guild wants more, and more again the week after. Whatever you spend on the shop has to earn its keep before Vane comes back."
msgstr "付清了。下周公会要得更多，再下周还要更多。你花在店里的每一笔钱，都得在韦恩回来之前赚回本。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:90
msgid ""
"That curio pays on chests bought sight unseen: bought without shaking, dropping or putting the lodestone to them. The witchlight's fine. A '?' on a card means it uses a word like that: hover over it to read it."
msgstr ""
"这件奇物只对盲买的宝箱起作用：也就是没摇、没摔、没用磁石碰过就买下的宝箱。用巫灯照照倒无妨。卡片上有“?”，就说明它用到了这类说法：把鼠标悬停在上面就能看解释。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:92
msgid ""
"Bram's word is me vouching for you on a Guild night you can't pay: the Guild takes all your gold, and what's still owed, half as much again, goes on next week's due. Once a run, and never in the last week."
msgstr ""
"布拉姆的担保，就是在你缴不起贡金的公会之夜，由我替你作保：公会拿走你所有的金币，还欠的部分再加一半，记到下周的应缴贡金上。每局一次，最后一周不行。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:94
msgid ""
"Nim comes every night after closing with curios: oddments from the Locking, each bending one rule of the trade. One a night at first; his lantern brings more. Pick ones that work together: Nim notices what you buy and brings more like it. Don't ask what Nim is."
msgstr ""
"每晚打烊后，尼姆都会带着奇物上门：都是大封锁留下的小玩意儿，每件都能改写一条买卖的规矩。起初一晚只有一件；有了他的灯笼，就会多带些来。挑那些能相互配合的：尼姆会留意你买了什么，带来更多同类的货。别问尼姆到底是什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:97
msgid ""
"The regulars want things now: see the board on the left. When something they want comes out of a chest, hand it over instead of selling it. A commission always pays more than a sale, and a lot pays piece by piece."
msgstr "常客们开始托你找东西了：看看左边的告示板。他们要的东西一从箱子里出来，就交给他们，别卖掉。委托的报酬总比卖掉划算，而成批的委托会逐件付钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:99
msgid ""
"Someone wants this! Deliver it: a commission always pays more than selling it would."
msgstr "有人想要这个！交付给他：委托的报酬总比卖掉要多。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:100
msgid ""
"Something's happening in town today: two days every week are different. It's up in the top bar (click it to read it again), and your notebook's calendar shows what's coming this week and next."
msgstr "今天城里有事：每周都有两天与众不同。事件就写在顶栏上（点一下可以再看一遍），笔记本的日历上也有这周和下周的安排。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:102
msgid ""
"The Stranger. That chest's wrapped in iron chains: nothing inside can move, so there's nothing to hear. Drop it to feel how heavy it is. Heavy ones hold more."
msgstr "是那个陌生人。那只宝箱缠着铁链：里面的东西动弹不得，所以什么也听不见。摔一下，掂掂它有多重。越重的装得越多。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:104
msgid ""
"A royal seal! That's one of King Aldric's own chests, gilded. The seller thinks the gold is paint, and priced it as the colour underneath."
msgstr "皇家印记！这是奥德里克国王本人的宝箱，镀了金的。卖家以为那层金是漆，就按底下的颜色定了价。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:106
msgid ""
"Look at that purse: enough to pay off the whole back-tithe, every week of it, right now! Do it, and the stall is ours early. Or keep trading first: the Guild only ever asks for this week's."
msgstr "瞧瞧这钱袋：够把欠下的贡金一口气全还清了，每一周的都够，现在就能还！还了，摊位就提前归咱们了。或者先接着做买卖：公会每次只收这一周的。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:108
msgid ""
"Short? Pawn what's on display, or your curios, at the Guild's price. If even that isn't enough, the Guild seals the shop."
msgstr "钱不够？把陈列的东西或者你的奇物，按公会的价钱典当掉。要是这样还不够，公会就会查封店铺。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:109
msgid ""
"Short, and folk owe you a favour? Call on them first: each brings an eighth of the due, once a season. That's what friends are for."
msgstr "钱不够，又有人欠你人情？先去找他们：每人能带来应缴贡金的八分之一，每季一次。朋友不就是干这个的嘛。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:110
msgid ""
"Gold! A legend, that. They're made, not mended: no restorer or lucky charm will ever turn a thing gold. It went into that chest gold."
msgstr ""
"金色！这可是传说级的。这种东西是造出来的，不是修出来的：再好的修复师、再灵的幸运符，也没法把一件东西变成金色。它装进那只箱子的时候就是金色的。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:111
msgid ""
"The Hooded Woman pays in shards of the Aldric Key. If you can't find what she wants this week, she'll ask again next week."
msgstr "兜帽女子用奥德里克之钥的碎片当报酬。这周要是找不到她要的东西，下周她还会再来要。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:114
msgid ""
"Thornwick folk bring two new sounds. Potions slosh at a gentle shake, like coin. Spells (scrolls and spellbooks) rustle only at a hard shake, like cloaks. And some chests are locked, or have a false bottom. It'll be a quiet first day, while word gets round."
msgstr ""
"荆棘镇的人会带来两种新声音。药水轻摇就会哗啦响，跟钱币一样。法术（卷轴和法术书）只有猛摇才会沙沙响，跟斗篷一样。还有些宝箱上了锁，或者带夹层。头一天会冷清些，得等消息传开。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:117
msgid ""
"Locked. Buy it and you'll pick the lock before you open it. A crowbar's quicker, but it breaks glass."
msgstr "上了锁。买下它的话，开箱前得先撬锁。用撬棍更快，但会打碎玻璃。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:118
msgid ""
"Dropped! A solid thud means a plain chest. A hollow boom means a false bottom: something hidden that nobody's priced."
msgstr "摔了一下！一声结实的闷响，说明箱子没有夹层。空空的一声“咚”，说明有夹层：里面藏着没人计价的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:119
msgid ""
"Hear that boom? A false bottom. Tick it on your slip: whatever's down there, nobody's priced it."
msgstr "听见那声“咚”了吗？是夹层。在估价单上勾选它：不管底下藏着什么，都没人给它定过价。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:120
msgid ""
"Glass breaks when you drop it. If you heard a slosh, think twice before dropping."
msgstr "玻璃一摔就碎。要是听到了哗啦声，摔之前可要三思。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:121
msgid ""
"That slosh is a potion. It's delicate, like coin: a clank drowns it out."
msgstr "那哗啦声是药水。它跟钱币一样细微：哐啷声会盖过它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:122
msgid ""
"A rustle: a spell, a scroll or a spellbook. Soft, like a cloak: it only sounds at a hard shake."
msgstr "沙沙声：是法术，卷轴或者法术书。它跟斗篷一样轻软：只有猛摇才会出声。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:123
msgid ""
"Crownhold brings gems, which tinkle at a gentle shake; archmages, whose things are often enchanted (a witchlight would show it); and lots with two or three of a kind. Count the rattles: click a row again for each one."
msgstr ""
"王冠堡会带来宝石，轻摇就会叮铃作响；还有大法师，他们的东西常常附魔（巫灯能照出来）；还有同类东西装了两三件的箱子。数清响声：每多一件，就再点一次那一行。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:125
msgid "A tinkle: a gem. Delicate, and worth the most."
msgstr "叮铃一声：宝石。声音娇弱，却最值钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:126
msgid ""
"The witchlight's lit, and it stays lit: anything enchanted glows when it makes a sound. Click the star on a row to mark one enchanted."
msgstr "巫灯点亮了，而且会一直亮着：任何附魔物品发出声响时都会发光。点击某一行上的星星，就能把其中一件标为附魔。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:128
msgid ""
"Two of a kind: each one adds its value. Sellers who don't count only price one."
msgstr "同类两件：每一件都各算一份价值。不数数的卖家只算一件的钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:129
msgid ""
"It glowed! That one's enchanted, and worth twice as much. Click the star on its row to mark it."
msgstr "它发光了！那件是附魔的，价值翻倍。点击它那一行上的星星，把它标出来。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:130
msgid ""
"The Royal Emporium. Court folk, the Maw's creatures up through the cracks in the Gate, and Gilt, who sells demon gold: gilded iron that jingles just like the real thing. A lodestone would catch it."
msgstr "皇家商行。这里有宫廷里的人，有从大门裂缝里钻上来的巨口爪牙，还有吉尔特，他卖魔金：镀金的铁，叮当声跟真金一模一样。磁石能揭穿它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:132
msgid ""
"The lodestone's on, so iron can't move. Weapons go quiet, and nothing drowns out the delicate things. Demon gold, which is iron under the gilt, goes quiet too."
msgstr "磁石开着，铁器就动弹不得。兵器没了声响，细微的东西也不会再被盖过。魔金镀层底下是铁，所以也会没声。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:134
msgid ""
"That's all the shaking this one will stand: it's coming apart. Go by what you heard."
msgstr "这只箱子就只经得起摇这么多了：它快散架了。凭你听到的来判断吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:137
msgid ""
"That sound... I've heard it once in forty years. A Heartsong! Only a Keywright hears one sing, so the seller has no idea it's there. It's worth nothing in gold and everything to the shop: buy that chest. And if you can't afford it, pass: a Heartsong won't leave with them."
msgstr ""
"这声音……我四十年里只听过一次。是心歌！只有钥匠能听见它歌唱，所以卖家根本不知道它在里面。论金子它一文不值，对咱们的店却是无价之宝：买下那只宝箱。要是买不起，就别买：心歌不会跟他们走的。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:140
msgid ""
"A Heartsong. Nobody would pay a penny for one, but each does something for the shop that no gold can, for as long as it sings here. Keep it or let it go: every one you keep makes the next harder to find."
msgstr ""
"一首心歌。没人会为它出一个铜板，可只要它在这里歌唱，每首心歌都能为店里做到金子做不到的事。留着它，或者放它归去：你每留下一首，下一首就更难找到。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:142
msgid ""
"Hear that? The whole stall's different with it singing. It'll sing as long as it's ours."
msgstr "听见了吗？有它在歌唱，整个摊位都不一样了。只要它还归咱们，就会一直唱下去。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:143
msgid ""
"One more thing. Somewhere among all these chests are nine Heartsongs: things loved so much they sing. Only a Keywright hears them, at the gentlest shake. Most seasons never hear one. If you ever do, buy that chest."
msgstr ""
"还有一件事。这么多宝箱里，藏着九首心歌：被人爱得太深、以至于会唱歌的东西。只有钥匠听得见，轻摇一下就能听到。大多数时候，一季下来一首也碰不上。要是你哪天听见了，就买下那只宝箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:148
msgid ""
"Ada only shakes gently, so heavy things and soft things make no sound for her."
msgstr "艾达只会轻摇，所以沉重的和轻软的东西在她手里都不会出声。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:149
msgid ""
"Tobin's Barrow chests are rotten: about two seconds of shaking, all told. One strength, then: pick it well."
msgstr "托宾从古冢带来的箱子都朽了：前前后后大约只经得起摇两秒。所以只能用一种力度：好好挑。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:150
msgid ""
"Nettle puts her price up a tenth for every strength you try after the first. Pick two: gentle and hard."
msgstr "第一种力度之后，你每多试一种，荨麻就把价钱涨十分之一。挑两种就够了：轻摇和猛摇。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:151
msgid ""
"Mother Sorrel always dreams true, in signs. If you can't hear what she dreamt of, it's warded: name it."
msgstr "索蕾尔婆婆的梦总会应验，只是借征兆说话。要是你听不到她梦见的东西，那它就被结界封住了：说出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:152
msgid ""
"A Thornwick dowry always holds coin, a cloak and a potion. Whichever of the three you can't hear is warded."
msgstr "荆棘镇的嫁妆箱里总有钱币、一件斗篷和一瓶药水。三样里哪样听不到，哪样就被结界封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:153
msgid ""
"Ilse's tag lists every kind of thing packed. A kind on the tag that never makes a sound is warded: name it."
msgstr "伊尔丝的标签列出了装进去的每一种东西。标签上有、却始终不出声的那种，就被结界封住了：说出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:154
msgid ""
"Quire's ward-roll names the warded thing, faded. Make out the name, and tick its kind."
msgstr "奎尔的结界名录上写着被封住的东西，只是字迹褪色了。辨认出名字，再勾选它的种类。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:155
msgid ""
"Madame Zell's cards: a suit drawn twice is what the ward holds. Three different suits, and nothing's warded."
msgstr "泽尔夫人的牌：抽中两次的花色，就是结界里封着的东西。三种花色各不相同，就什么也没封。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:156
msgid ""
"A warded thing makes no sound and weighs nothing. Name it on your slip, and nothing that isn't there, and the ward will give it up."
msgstr "被结界封住的东西不出声，也没有重量。在估价单上说出它，同时别勾任何箱里没有的东西，结界就会交出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:158
msgid ""
"You could pay off the Guild now. Or buy its Bookkeeping Engine for the same sum: it reads every chest for you, to finish the run quickly."
msgstr "你现在就能还清欠公会的债了。或者花同样的钱买下公会的记账机：它会替你看透每只宝箱，让你快快结束这一局。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:160
msgid ""
"Rook's scale says what her chest weighs. Take away the weight of what you heard: what's left never stirred (a cloak is 3 lb, a spell 1)."
msgstr "鲁克的秤会显示她的箱子有多重。减去你听到的东西的重量：剩下的就是没摇动的东西（一件斗篷3磅，一卷法术1磅）。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:162
msgid ""
"Brass's ticket counts every article, false bottom and all. Count what you hear: one short means one under the floor."
msgstr "布拉斯的当票把每件物品都算上了，连夹层里的也不例外。数数你听到几件：少一件，就说明底板下藏着一件。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:163
msgid ""
"Flick's chests are mostly stolen. Lay a hand on each one: if your mark goes cold, send for the Wardens, or pass."
msgstr "弗利克的箱子大多是偷来的。每只都伸手摸一摸：要是钥纹发凉，就报告巡守，或者别买。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:165
msgid ""
"The Guild's bailiff, selling what it took for tithe to its friends: cheap, by the colour alone. But a lot of what the Guild takes was never the Guild's to sell. Lay a hand on every one."
msgstr "公会的法警，把以贡金名义收走的东西卖给公会的朋友：很便宜，只看颜色定价。可公会收走的东西，很多本来就轮不到它来卖。每只都伸手摸一摸。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:167
msgid ""
"The Wardens' quartermaster sells what nobody claimed, by the pound. A heavy chest comes dear and a light one cheap: take the weight of what you hear from his scale's."
msgstr "巡守的军需官卖的是没人认领的东西，按磅计价。重箱子贵，轻箱子便宜：从他秤上的重量里，减去你听到的东西的重量。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:169
msgid ""
"Brother Cadoc won't have his chests shaken hard: half again if you do. Crypt chests are full of holy cloaks."
msgstr "卡多克修士不许别人猛摇他的箱子：你要是猛摇，价钱就涨一半。地下墓穴里的箱子装满了圣袍。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:170
msgid ""
"Corvin packs his chests in straw: everything needs a strength harder to stir, and cloaks and spells won't stir at all. Shake firmly, then hard, then drop it."
msgstr "科尔文用稻草把箱子塞得满满的：每样东西都要高一档的力度才摇得动，斗篷和法术则根本摇不动。先稳摇，再猛摇，然后摔一下。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:172
msgid ""
"Orme likes a wager: read her chest exactly, every kind and every count, and she gives back a third of the price."
msgstr "奥姆喜欢打赌：把她的箱子判断得分毫不差，种类和数量全都对，她就退还三分之一的价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:173
msgid ""
"Solve grandmother's riddle. If you can't hear what it's about, it's warded: name it."
msgstr "解开祖母的谜语。要是你听不到谜语说的那样东西，它就被结界封住了：说出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:174
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan takes the best weapon in his chest, for the fee he names. Value what's left."
msgstr "罗文爵士会拿走他箱子里最好的那件兵器，付你他报的那笔钱。估一估剩下的东西值多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:175
msgid "Tick gives you twelve seconds. Gently, then hard, and decide."
msgstr "嘀嗒只给你十二秒。先轻摇，再猛摇，然后拿主意。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:176
msgid ""
"Sallow is cheap, but the dearest thing inside is his. A chest of many middling things suits his bargain."
msgstr "萨洛要价便宜，但箱里最贵重的东西归他。要是箱子里装着许多不好不坏的东西，跟他做这笔交易最划算。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:177
msgid ""
"Skrae's echoes come back off everything, warded or not. An echo with nothing to hear is warded."
msgstr "斯克雷的回声会从每样东西上弹回来，不管有没有被结界封住。有回声、却听不到声音的那样，就被结界封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:178
msgid ""
"Countess Vey prices only her gems; the rest comes free. Some are paste, and she won't have a lodestone near them."
msgstr "维伯爵夫人只给她的宝石定价，其余的都白送。其中有些是仿造宝石，而且她不许磁石靠近它们。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:179
msgid ""
"Old Aldo's price is your slip. Get it exactly right and he takes a quarter off; get it wrong and you pay what it holds, and a quarter more."
msgstr "老奥尔多的要价就是你的估价单。估得分毫不差，他就减价四分之一；估错了，你就得按箱里东西的实际价值付钱，还要再多付四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Hints.cs:181
msgid ""
"The Maw sells for one coin, but everyone who comes after him today asks twice as much. Count who's still waiting."
msgstr "巨口只卖一枚金币，可今天在他之后来的人都会要价翻倍。数数后面还有几个人在等。"

